# ==============================================================================
# NAME: United States Internet Services Rule-Set (USA_SERVICE.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Covers US-based internet services, media, social platforms,
#              developer tools, cloud/CDN & fintech not covered by dedicated
#              brand rule-sets (Excludes Google, Microsoft/GitHub, Amazon, Meta,
#              OpenAI, Anthropic, X/xAI/SpaceX, Cloudflare, Discord & PayPal).
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zezetata/Proxyer/master/USA_SERVICE.list,"🇺🇸 USA Service",extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

